.error-report-container
  p(style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; text-align: left; font-size: 12px; color: #555;")
    | Postbird encountered an unexpected error. Nothing is sent automatically. You can review the sanitized details below and report it on GitHub or via email.
  code.result= reportText

p.buttons
  button.btn-report-github(type="button") Report on GitHub
  button.btn-report-email(type="button") Send via Email
  button.btn-copy-error(type="button") Copy Details
  button.cancel(type="button") Close
